{"id":"vod_md_4490","vodId":"4490","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"超能力女儿","name_cn":"超能力女儿","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230908-1/e815ff4c940ae1a0aab6888161d72024.jpg"},"summary":"新田义史（中岛良树 配音）是就职于芦川组的黑社会干部，虽然长相非常的凶恶，从事的也是令人闻风丧胆的职业，但实际上，新田义史拥有一颗十分善良的心灵。一天，一个神秘的椭圆形物体掉落到了新田义史的房间里，在那里出现了一个美丽的少女雏（田中贵子 配音）。面无表情的雏向新田义史强大的念动力，迫于雏的淫威，新田义史不得不让她以女儿的身份住进自己的家中，就这样，黑社会人事和超能力少女的同居生活开始了。因为拥有非常强大的力量，雏常常会失控暴走，制造了一堆麻烦留给新田义史来扫尾。起初，“父女”两人之间的关系十分紧张，但随着时间的推移，竟然真的生出的亲情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-08 08:24:02","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/SFaYLbh2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/XZXiMa0F/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/kbHTZnI9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/qEhf9AFu/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/PnibgiTB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/Y9D596cP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/LGkI4fWC/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/kaMzStlF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/1FQBAbA5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/Cw37u8ap/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/7C71MWDh/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/TZPdLJFC/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:45.624Z"}